{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-12-14 09:30:00', 'title': "CME GROUP'S MICRO WTI OPTIONS VOLUME SURPASSES 100,000 CONTRACTS TRADED", 'text': 'CHICAGO , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CME GROUP, THE WORLD\'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT MICRO WTI OPTIONS VOLUME SURPASSED 100,000 CONTRACTS ON DECEMBER 13, 2022. "TRADERS ARE FACING UNPRECEDENTED VOLATILITY AS MARKETS REACT TO RECESSION RISK, OPEC AND U.S PRODUCTION SHIFTS, CHANGING DEMAND FROM CHINA, GEOPOLITICAL EVENTS AND OTHER FACTORS," SAID PETER KEAVEY, GLOBAL HEAD OF ENERGY AND ENVIRONMENTAL PRODUCTS AT CME GROUP.'}{'symbol': 'CME', 'date': '2022-12-14 09:00:00', 'title': 'CME GROUP ANNOUNCES 2023 ANNUAL MEETING DATE', 'text': "CHICAGO , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CME GROUP INC. (NASDAQ: CME), THE WORLD'S LEADING DERIVATIVES MARKETPLACE, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT WILL CONDUCT ITS 2023 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS AT 10:00 A.M. CENTRAL TIME ON THURSDAY, MAY 4, 2023."}